              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "i made this drink for my party and everybody fell for it. i was so happy that it wasn't a big flop. i would suggest to anybody to make this drink. it is a great party drink or if your like me i keep the cubes in my freezer almost all the time. so in other words it was great!"
