            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lucky Noodles"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for the Faceless Frenzy weekend 2013. OMG this is so refreshing! I didn't have cranberry so I used grape juice. DH even liked it. After taking the photo I decided to add a bit of vodka - over the top! Cannot wait for summer to enjoy this on a beach. Thanks Blair.",
